ac-13: Heartbeat ping ✓ (heartbeat.ts)\n- ac-14: Connection timeout ✓ (heartbeat.ts)\n- ac-15: Plugin pattern for middleware ✓\n\nTest coverage in tests/daemon-*.test.ts files (1166 tests pass).\n\nNeed to verify: ac-16 (standalone executable compilation). Will check build configuration.\"`","kind":"execute","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"text","text":"Document current state analysis"}}]}}}
