ry\n\nImplemented the inbox view feature with full CRUD functionality.\n\n- Inbox list displays items ordered by created_at desc\n- Item cards show text, tags, author, and relative timestamps  \n- Add functionality with toggle button and Enter-to-submit input\n- Delete with confirmation dialog\n- Loading states and error handling\n- Hover animations for better UX\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] Build succeeds (vite build)\n- [x] All 1207 tests pass\n- [x] No regressions in existing functionality\n- [ ] Manual testing: Start daemon, add inbox items via UI\n- [ ] Manual testing: Delete inbox items with confirmation\n- [ ] Manual testing: Verify timestamps display correctly\n\n## Technical Details\n\n**API Integration:**\n- Extended \\`api.ts\\` with inbox endpoints\n- \\`fetchInbox()\\` - GET /api/inbox with pagination\n- \\`addInboxItem()\\` - POST /api/inbox\n- \\`deleteInboxItem()\\` - DELETE /api/inbox/:ref\n\n**Component Structure:**\n- Single-file component using SvelteKit conventions\n- shadcn-svelte components (Card, Button, Input, Dialog, Badge)\n- Proper AC annotations throughout\n\n**Acceptance Criteria Coverage:**\n- ac-16: List ordered by created_at desc ✅\n- ac-17: Add button reveals input field ✅\n- ac-18: New item appears at top ✅\n- ac-19: Delete with confirmation dialog ✅\n\nTask: @01KFMMTD\nSpec: @web-dashboard\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\nEOF\n)\"`","kind":"execute","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"text","text":"Create pull request"}}]}}}
